    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d330">

                <pb facs="0401" n="385" sameAs="frus:frus1947v08/pg385"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">124.241/6–1347: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Embassy in Bolivia </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-06-23T19:00:00-04:00">June 23, 1947—7
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>356. Urtel 565, June 13.<anchor n="89" xml:id="d330-f1"/> Dept has no knowledge
                    basis belief lend-lease obligation would be reduced or cancelled. Possibly some
                    confusion arose because of fact payment requested of Bolivia is only 18% of full
                    value. Please make clear that Dept. expects payment in dollars or Bolivianos of
                    full equivalent of dollar indebtedness of approximately $900,000.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Marshall</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
